<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Loan Approval Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .details {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #2c5282;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Loan Approval Notification</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

        <p>We are pleased to inform you that your loan application has been approved. Below are the details of your loan:</p>

        <div class="details">
            <h3>Loan Details</h3>
            <p><span class="highlight">Loan ID:</span> {{loanId}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Account Number:</span> {{accountNumber}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Loan Amount:</span> ${{loanAmount}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Interest Rate:</span> {{interestRate}}%</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Term:</span> {{term}} months</p>
        </div>

        <div class="details">
            <h3>Payment Summary</h3>
            <p><span class="highlight">Monthly Payment:</span> ${{monthlyPayment}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Total Interest:</span> ${{totalInterest}}</p>
            <p><span class="highlight">Total Amount:</span> ${{totalAmount}}</p>
       </div>

        <p>Please find attached a detailed loan agreement document for your records.</p>

        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>Your Company Name</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
        <p>© {{currentYear}} Your Company Name. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 